## Phase exit gate (every phase)

At the **end** of each phase run this gate **before** opening the next (`/phase-exit`). Write leftovers into Profile / `concept-domain.mdc` / `phase-plan.mdc`.

### Exit checklist (copy per phase)

- [ ] Every line item in `phase-plan.mdc` for this phase is `done` or explicitly `deferred (reason)`
- [ ] **Default rules** still intact (`CURSOR.md` → Rule map)
- [ ] Each function's **Done when** verified; tests for this phase's functions pass
- [ ] Smoke / manual test of this phase's deliverables passed
- [ ] Known bugs listed (fix now vs carry to next phase)
- [ ] Gaps / adds for **next phase** written into `phase-plan.mdc` (not chat-only)
- [ ] Nothing from a **later** phase was half-started (or reverted / parked)
- [ ] **AI Handoff Log** row added (`CURSOR.md`)
- [ ] User/AI agree: **exit OK** → advance Current phase

If anything fails: fix or document carry-over — do **not** silently advance.

