## P3 — API backend

**Goal:** the real API, built **endpoint by endpoint**, matching the P2 contracts. UI still on mocks.

### Subs

- [ ] P3.1 **Bootstrap** — router, request/response helpers, `jsonSuccess()` / `jsonError()` (one consistent shape), error handler, CORS from env, request logging
- [ ] P3.2 **DB access** — `Database::query()`/`execute()` with **prepared statements only**; transaction helper
- [ ] P3.3 **Migrations applied** on local DB; seeds usable
- [ ] P3.4 **Auth** — `register()`, `login()`, `logout()`, `refresh()`/session, `me()`, password hashing/verify, token/session issue + expiry
- [ ] P3.5 **Middleware** — `authenticate()`, `requireRole(...roles)`, ownership check `canAccess(user, resource)`, rate limit on auth
- [ ] P3.6 **Validation layer** — server validators per endpoint as named functions; **every write validated server-side**; errors map to field names matching the UI form fields
- [ ] P3.7 **Endpoints, one by one** — for each row in the endpoint inventory, a Function Spec covering: route, handler function, service function(s), repository function(s), validator, authz, response shape, error cases, tests. Typical set per entity: `list` (filter/sort/paginate), `get`, `create`, `update`, `delete` (soft-delete if norm), plus concept-specific actions
- [ ] P3.8 **Special endpoints** if in concept: file upload (type/size/path checks), payments, notifications, exports
- [ ] P3.9 **Per-endpoint tests** — happy · validation fail (422 with field errors) · unauthenticated (401) · forbidden (403) · not found (404)
- [ ] P3.10 **API smoke run** — Postman-style/manual collection covering every endpoint; saved in repo
- [ ] P3.11 **Contract list** — final routes + payloads vs P2 contracts; diffs noted for P4

### Exit (P3 → P4)

Run **Phase exit gate**. Verify: every inventory endpoint `done` with tests; authz enforced server-side (not UI-only); prepared statements everywhere; contract diffs listed; UI still on mocks is OK.

---

## P4 — Integration (API ↔ UI) + mock cleanup

**Goal:** the UI runs on the real API, feature by feature, with no silent mock fallbacks.

### Subs

- [ ] P4.1 **API client** — `apiClient.request()` (base URL from env, auth header, JSON, timeout), typed wrappers per endpoint; error normalization
- [ ] P4.2 **Auth wiring** — login/logout/refresh, session persistence, `RequireAuth`/`RequireRole` on real session, 401 → sign-out flow
- [ ] P4.3 **Feature-by-feature cutover** (not big-bang): for each feature in plan order — swap `mockApi.<entity>.*` for real service functions, verify, then delete that mock's usage
- [ ] P4.4 **Error mapping** — API field errors → form field errors; status codes → shared error/empty/404 screens
- [ ] P4.5 **Loading/empty/error** verified on real latency and real empty data
- [ ] P4.6 **Pagination / filters / infinite scroll** wired to real query params
- [ ] P4.7 **Mocks removed or quarantined** — only behind an explicit dev flag, never in production builds
- [ ] P4.8 **SEO meta + Schema.org** if SEO = `on`
- [ ] P4.9 **End-to-end happy paths** per role on the real API
- [ ] P4.10 **Layout re-check** — real data (long text, many rows) at 375 · 768 · 1280

### Exit (P4 → P5)

Run **Phase exit gate**. Verify: no silent mock fallbacks in prod builds; remaining mocks listed for P5 delete; integration bugs triaged; e2e paths pass.

---

## P5 — Cleanup, documentation, final testing

### Subs

- [ ] P5.1 **Delete** dead code, unused routes/components, leftover mocks and flags
- [ ] P5.2 **Docs** — README/setup/env, migrate + seed commands, API reference (endpoint list), GitHub Secret **names** (not values)
- [ ] P5.3 **Regression pass** — roles × critical flows × three layout classes
- [ ] P5.4 **a11y** spot-check (forms, focus, contrast, reduced motion) and **security** smoke (authz, uploads, injection, secrets scan)
- [ ] P5.5 **Performance** sanity — main pages, bundle/lazy chunks, image sizes
- [ ] P5.6 **Deploy checklist** from `/deploy` — GitHub Secrets complete (FTP, DB, API/app hosts, all env keys)
- [ ] P5.7 **Phase notes closed**; `phase-plan.mdc` all `done`/`deferred`; Profile Current phase = `done`

### Exit (P5 → done)

Run **Phase exit gate**. No open P1–P4 carry items unless accepted as known backlog. Ship only when exit OK.

